Description:
Unified Chromium 144+, W3C, WHATWG, MDN Baseline 2026, TC39 ES2026, WebAssembly 3.0, and MCP 2026 schema catalog.

Local Modifications:
- Merges yolo-standards schemas (google-chrome, mdn, tc39, webassembly, mcp) directly into yolo-bun/third_party/google/chrome-standards/schemas.
- Exposed via yolo-bun:web-guidelines and yolo-bun:chrome-standards.
